{"id": "EUVD-2026-102529", "enisaUuid": "01aea1b1-bcbe-3dfb-9c2e-0d05d77182b5", "description": "unarr through 1.1.1 contains a heap-based out-of-bounds read in zip_parse_extra_fields() in zip/parse-zip.c due to an incorrect ZIP64 extra field length check. Attackers can supply a crafted ZIP archive with 0xFFFFFFFF sentinel values and a truncated ZIP64 record to read past the heap buffer and crash the process.", "datePublished": "2026-10-15T21:43:20", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-15T21:43:20", "baseScore": 6.8, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haind-pwn/unarr-tar-zip-oob", "https://github.com/selmf/unarr/blob/b211040df83dee513362cdeb9bd87afa26fd5e38/zip/parse-zip.c#L48-L72", "https://github.com/selmf/unarr", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/unarr-through-1.1.1-heap-out-of-bounds-read-via-zip-parse-extra-fields"], "aliases": ["GHSA-rj75-52m6-37p5", "CVE-2026-111274"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.13, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "ee07fe6d-6db5-3532-8c18-def1ec5cda58", "product": {"name": "unarr", "vendor": {"name": "selmf"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.1.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "a63a8568-da0b-31fd-a597-d0a95fee5fea", "vendor": {"name": "selmf"}}], "isExploited": false}